<title>ITALY: Italian March car registrations rose 25.04 percent.</title>
<headline>Italian March car registrations rose 25.04 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations rose 25.04 percent to 220,500 units in March, compared with 176,348 in March 1996, the Italian Ministry of Transport said.  </p>
<p>In February 1997, Italian new car registrations rose 21.45 percent to 198,000 vehicles.</p>
<p>For the three month period January-March 1997, Italian new car registations rose 16.32 percent to 625,500 vehicles from 537,737 in the period January-March 1996.  </p>
